<title>SPAIN: FORECAST-Argentaria Q1 net seen down 15.5 p.</title>
<headline>FORECAST-Argentaria Q1 net seen down 15.5 p.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are on average forecasts of financial analysts for results of Spanish bank Corporacion Bancaria de Espana SA for the first-quarter of 1997. Argentaria is due to release results on April 23.</p>
<p>(In billions of pesetas)</p>
<p>				  Q1 1997     Q1 1996	Range</p>
<p>    Net interest income   49.49	 47.42    45.05-52.20</p>
<p>    Operating margin	23.41	 24.93    22.40-24.60</p>
<p>    Attributable profit   18.91	 22.39    16.90-20.14</p>
<p>Contributors: Ahorro Corporacion, Ibersecurities, Benito y Monjardin, Merrill Lynch and Inverban</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom + 34 1 585-2167</p>
</text>
